{"meta":{"id":"asyncio","category":"it/syntax/python/network","title":"asyncio · httpx (비동기) · Python","subtitle":"(PYTHON)","summary":"async/await, asyncio.gather 병렬 처리(Promise.all), return_exceptions","tags":["python","f-network","f-async"],"color":"sky","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-sky","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-sky-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-sky-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></span>PYTHON</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">asyncio · httpx (비동기) · Python</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-sky-50/70 border border-sky-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-sky-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> async/await, asyncio.gather 병렬 처리(Promise.all), return_exceptions</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">async / await (asyncio + httpx)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">import asyncio, httpx\r\n\r\nasync def get_user(client: httpx.AsyncClient, id: int) -&gt; dict:\r\n    res = await client.get(f&quot;/users/{id}&quot;)\r\n    res.raise_for_status()\r\n    return res.json()\r\n\r\nasync def main() -&gt; None:\r\n    async with httpx.AsyncClient(base_url=&quot;https://api.example.com&quot;) as client:\r\n        user = await get_user(client, 1)                 # 순차\r\n        a, b = await asyncio.gather(                     # Promise.all 대응\r\n            get_user(client, 1), get_user(client, 2),\r\n        )\r\n        results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks, return_exceptions=True)   # allSettled 대응\r\n\r\nasyncio.run(main())</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">주의</h2></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">async 함수 안에서 requests 같은 동기 호출을 하면 이벤트 루프 전체가 멈춘다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">gather 중 하나가 실패해도 이미 실행된 DB 작업은 롤백되지 않는다</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › async/await · Promise.all, Java › CompletableFuture</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/python/network/asyncio","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"python","title":"PYTHON","path":"it/syntax/python"},{"id":"network","title":"통신","path":"it/syntax/python/network"}],"hasImage":false}